          displayName="[LOCALIZED(56A2BC68-6347-4931-9D7A-9EB9F6EC02B1,*Handle failed Signing)]">
  <description>[LOCALIZED(1101EDE4-1AFA-47AB-BBF4-89D071F149D2,*Handle Signing that have failed (Rejected by receiver, not signed withing deadline, etc.))]</description>
